 CARNOT_ARC_GGUF_PATH override (REQ-ARC-WMTE-6621 amendment)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Design input from the induce-failure-fix agent: model_path wins over
the frozen repo pin at load time, and since 512eba... 512eca0e6b the
recorded label derives from the weights actually loaded — so an
env-overridden run may already measure the LIVE generator, and
refusing it would force --allow-retired-pin onto exactly the runs the
guard is not guarding against (their acceptance run and the supervisor
A/B both rely on the override). Non-empty override -> stderr note, no
refusal; whitespace-only is not an override; env unset (the DEFAULT
silently resolving retired weights — the origin failure) still refuses.

Also hardens the harness-wired test (deletes CARNOT_ARC_GGUF_PATH
first: with the override set the guard correctly stands down and
main() would proceed to real model work). Mutation: override branch
removed -> RED; restored 6/6 GREEN.

The two 20260726 artifacts were re-refreshed per the freshness lint
(the 4-line call-site edit re-drifts the recorded harness hash).
Verified inert: zero substantive fields moved; the wholesale-rewrite
note drop recurred and all rebuild_note_* keys were restored from
HEAD, recorded in rebuild_note_20260822_pin_guard_env_override.

